    "exact_text": "Approved: DCTN-2 RC1 shall use axial-only truss member actions; exact 50/50 channel sharing only under complete mid-plane symmetry; ASCE FRP/FRP one-to-three-row distributions with one bolt per row; the ASCE closed-section 0.50 characteristic pin-bearing reduction for the unfilled RHS full-through detail without a separate bolt-flexure equation; trusted-source-only full-depth SRS bearing; mirrored W/I single-lap sides with the ASCE 0.60 single-lap strength adjustment; independent hardware authority with no automatic double-shear multiplier; and fail-closed unsupported shared-chord cross-group paths."
